---

<Base title="Design options" description="Headline and logo options for review." noindex hasCanonical={false}>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">For Mandeep</p>
    <h1>Design options</h1>
    <p>Eight headlines and four logo marks, from an exploration of twenty. Pick one of each. This page is not linked anywhere and is not indexed.</p>
  </div>

  {heroes.map((h) => (
    <section class="opt-hero" aria-label={`Headline option ${h.id}`}>
      <p class="opt-label wrap">Headline {h.id} · {h.angle}</p>
      <div class="hero">
        <p class="badge"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{pill}</p>
        <h2 class="h1">{h.before}<br /><span class="accent">{h.accent}</span></h2>
        <p class="tagline">{sub}</p>
        <div class="checks">
          {checks.map((c, i) => (
            <a class:list={['check', { primary: i === 0 }]} href={`${base}/#how`}>
              <Icon name={c.icon} size={20} />
              <span>{c.label}{'note' in c && <small>{c.note}</small>}</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  ))}

  <section class="wrap logos" aria-labelledby="logos-h">
    <h2 id="logos-h">Logo marks</h2>
    <h3 class="sub-h">Exploration: twenty sketches</h3>
    <p>
      Image generation was not available in this session, so these were drawn quickly in code: lettermarks, abstract
      symbols, mascot-lite, badges and geometric marks. Rough on purpose. Each says why it was dropped or kept.
    </p>
    <ul class="sketches">
      {sketches.map((k) => (
        <li class:list={[{ kept: k.note.startsWith('shortlisted') }]}>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" width="72" height="72" aria-hidden="true" set:html={k.svg} />
          <span class="sk-label">{k.num} {k.label}</span>
          <span class="sk-note">{k.note}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <h3 class="sub-h">The four finals</h3>
    <p>
      Each in two tones (the mark in ink, one part in the brand colour) and in one colour, at 16, 32 and 64px, beside
      the wordmark and in a browser tab, on light and on dark.
    </p>
    <ul>
      {marks.map((m) => (
        <li>
          <p class="mark-name">{m.id === 'now' ? m.name : `${m.id}. ${m.name}`}</p>
          <p class="mark-note">{m.rationale}</p>
          <div class="panels">
            {['light', 'dark'].map((t) => (
              <div class:list={['panel', t]}>
                <div class="row">
                  <span class="row-label">Two-tone</span>
                  <div class="sizes">
                    {[16, 32, 64].map((px) => (
                      <span class="size">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" width={px} height={px} aria-hidden="true" set:html={m.svg} />
                        <small>{px}</small>
                      </span>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                  <div class="lockup">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" width="30" height="30" aria-hidden="true" set:html={m.svg} />
                    <span>polinrider</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row mono">
